Common Type LimitedEnglishProficiencyHistory [99533]
    documentation 'An indicator or metric computed for the student (e.g., at risk) to influence
                  'more effective education or direct specific interventions.
    date BeginDate [99940]
        documentation 'The date when the indicator was assigned or computed.
        is part of identity
    date EndDate [99942]
        documentation 'The date the indicator or metric was sunset or removed.
        is optional
    descriptor LimitedEnglishProficiency [991692]
        documentation 'An indication that the student has been identified as limited English
                      'proficient by the Language Proficiency Assessment Committee (LPAC), or English proficient.
        is optional
